      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SETUP TODOs\n1. Replace `documentId` on every Google Sheets node below with your Household Ledger spreadsheet ID (see household-ledger-sheets-schema.md)\n2. Connect your Google Sheets credential (reused the same credential ID as your BNS workflows below \u2014 adjust if this is a different Google account)\n3. Activate this workflow, then grab the Production webhook URL from the Webhook node \u2014 that's what the mobile app POSTs to\n\nExpected POST body:\n`{ \"action\": \"get\" }`\n`{ \"action\": \"upsert\", \"item\": \"Basmati Rice\", \"category\": \"Pantry\", \"store\": \"Walmart\", \"price\": 9.52, \"qty\": 1, \"cadence\": \"Week\" }`\n`{ \"action\": \"remove\", \"item\": \"Basmati Rice\" }`\n\nResponse: `{ \"list\": [...rows], \"total\": 42.10, \"budget\": 200, \"remaining\": 157.90 }`",
